#. source.
msgid "Invalid saved land purchase rules."
msgstr "저장된 토지 구입 규칙이 잘못되었습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Name of your new city"
msgstr "새 도시 이름"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid city name."
msgstr "잘못된 도시 이름입니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Purchase request"
msgstr "구입 요청"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Land sale offer"
msgstr "토지 매각 제안"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The city snapshot could not be prepared for transfer."
msgstr "전송할 도시 스냅샷을 준비하지 못했습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Remaining land allowance: %s · Price per tile: %s"
msgstr "남은 토지 지원금: %s · 타일당 가격: %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Competitive Region"
msgstr "지역 경쟁"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Victory goal"
msgstr "승리 목표"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Endless game"
msgstr "무제한 게임"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Wealth (funds minus debt)"
msgstr "자산 (자금에서 부채 차감)"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid saved victory goal."
msgstr "저장된 승리 목표가 잘못되었습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can continue the completed game without scoring."
msgstr "호스트만 종료된 게임을 점수 집계 없이 계속할 수 있습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The game continues without scoring."
msgstr "점수 집계 없이 게임을 계속합니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The victory target was reached. The host can continue without scoring."
msgstr "승리 목표에 도달했습니다. 호스트가 점수 집계 없이 계속할 수 있습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "This city is not available."
msgstr "이 도시는 이용할 수 없습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "City view changed."
msgstr "도시 화면이 변경되었습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Your city view changed. Review the target before acting."
msgstr "도시 화면이 변경되었습니다. 작업 전에 대상을 확인하세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid region command."
msgstr "잘못된 지역 명령입니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"You are visiting another city. Only your emergency services may assist here."
msgstr "다른 도시를 방문 중입니다. 이곳에서는 내 긴급 구조대로만 지원할 수 있습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Region cities own their entire map. Land trading is available in Shared "
"mode."
msgstr "지역 모드의 도시는 지도 전체를 소유합니다. 토지 거래는 공유 모드에서 이용할 수 있습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Neighbouring cities"
msgstr "이웃 도시"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Victory"
msgstr "승리"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Continue without scoring (endless)"
msgstr "점수 집계 없이 계속 (무제한)"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Neighbouring cities are available in Region mode."
msgstr "이웃 도시는 지역 모드에서 이용할 수 있습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Visit any city to watch. During disasters you may deploy your own emergency "
"services; other changes remain with its owner."
msgstr "도시를 방문하여 관찰할 수 있습니다. 재해 중에는 내 긴급 구조대를 배치할 수 있으며, 그 외 변경은 소유자만 가능합니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Return to your city"
msgstr "내 도시로 돌아가기"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Visit city"
msgstr "도시 방문"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Victory: %s. The game is paused. Leave or let the host continue without "
"scoring."
msgstr "승리: %s. 게임이 일시 정지되었습니다. 나가거나 호스트가 점수 집계 없이 계속하도록 하세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Visiting another city: watch or deploy your own emergency services."
msgstr "다른 도시 방문 중: 관찰하거나 내 긴급 구조대를 배치하세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Readiness can only be changed in the lobby."
msgstr "준비 상태는 대기실에서만 변경할 수 있습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Readiness updated."
msgstr "준비 상태가 갱신되었습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can start when all connected players are ready."
msgstr "연결된 모든 플레이어가 준비되면 호스트만 시작할 수 있습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The game has started."
msgstr "게임이 시작되었습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Wait until the host starts the game."
msgstr "호스트가 게임을 시작할 때까지 기다리세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Game lobby"
msgstr "게임 대기실"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "준비 완료"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Not ready"
msgstr "준비 안 됨"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Offline"
msgstr "오프라인"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Start game"
msgstr "게임 시작"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"At least two players must join. Everyone confirms Ready; the host then "
"starts the game. Changes to the player list reset readiness."
msgstr ""
"최소 두 명이 참가해야 합니다. 모두 준비 완료를 확인하면 호스트가 시작합니다. 플레이어 목록이 변경되면 준비 상태가 초기화됩니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Simulation and construction begin together after the host starts."
msgstr "호스트가 시작하면 시뮬레이션과 건설이 함께 시작됩니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Net wealth"
msgstr "순자산"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Open scoreboard"
msgstr "순위표 열기"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Endless game · no scoring"
msgstr "무제한 게임 · 점수 집계 없음"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Victory target: %s"
msgstr "승리 목표: %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "You: %s / %s"
msgstr "나: %s / %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Leading: %s · %s"
msgstr "선두: %s · %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Net wealth = city funds minus outstanding debt."
msgstr "순자산 = 도시 자금에서 미상환 부채를 뺀 금액입니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Population of your own city."
msgstr "내 도시의 인구입니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "History"
msgstr "기록"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Unranked"
msgstr "순위 제외"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"History begins when the game starts; a new sample is recorded each month."
msgstr "게임이 시작되면 기록을 시작하며, 매월 표본을 기록합니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Month %d"
msgstr "%d개월"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Player colours · hover over a line for exact values"
msgstr "플레이어 색상 · 선 위에 마우스를 올리면 정확한 값 표시"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Rematch · rotate starts"
msgstr "재대결 · 시작 위치 순환"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"No unused fair starting positions remain. Create a new game with new "
"terrain."
msgstr "사용하지 않은 공정한 시작 위치가 없습니다. 새 지형으로 새 게임을 만드세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can propose a rematch after the result."
msgstr "결과가 나온 뒤에는 호스트만 재대결을 제안할 수 있습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Rematch prepared with new starting positions. Everyone must confirm Ready "
"again."
msgstr "새 시작 위치로 재대결을 준비했습니다. 모두 준비 완료를 다시 확인해야 합니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Target held: %d / %d game days"
msgstr "목표 유지: %d / %d 게임일"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Unranked · city founded after the start"
msgstr "순위 제외 · 시작 후 설립된 도시"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Stay at or above the target for one full game year. Dropping below resets "
"the timer."
msgstr "게임 시간으로 1년 동안 목표 이상을 유지하세요. 목표 아래로 내려가면 시간이 초기화됩니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Rules are fixed at start: hold the target for one game year; late-founded "
"cities are unranked. Shared starts receive equal land grants."
msgstr ""
"시작 시 규칙이 확정됩니다. 목표를 게임 시간으로 1년간 유지해야 하며, 늦게 설립된 도시는 순위에서 제외됩니다. 공유 모드에서는 같은 "
"면적의 초기 토지를 받습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Player loans"
msgstr "플레이어 간 대출"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Both players confirm the terms. Interest is paid each year; principal is due"
" at maturity. Unpaid amounts remain debt; interest does not compound."
msgstr ""
"두 플레이어가 조건을 확인합니다. 이자는 매년 지급하며 원금은 만기에 상환합니다. 미납액은 부채로 남고, 이자에 이자가 붙지 않습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Proposal"
msgstr "제안"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Request a loan"
msgstr "대출 요청"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Offer a loan"
msgstr "대출 제안"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Fixed annual interest (%)"
msgstr "고정 연 이자율 (%)"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Term (game years)"
msgstr "기간 (게임 연도)"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Confirm and send proposal"
msgstr "확인 후 제안 보내기"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "%s → %s · %s · %d%% annually · %d years"
msgstr "%s → %s · %s · 연 %d%% · %d년"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Accept fixed terms"
msgstr "고정 조건 수락"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Outstanding: %s · Unpaid interest: %s · Maturity: game day %d"
msgstr "미상환액: %s · 미납 이자: %s · 만기: 게임 %d일"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid loan terms or contract limit reached."
msgstr "대출 조건이 잘못되었거나 계약 한도에 도달했습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Loan proposal sent. The other player must confirm the fixed terms."
msgstr "대출 제안을 보냈습니다. 상대 플레이어가 고정 조건을 확인해야 합니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Loan proposal withdrawn or declined."
msgstr "대출 제안이 철회되거나 거절되었습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The lender cannot fund this loan or the receiving treasury is full."
msgstr "대출자가 이 대출을 제공할 수 없거나 수령 도시의 자금이 한도에 도달했습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Loan accepted. Annual interest and the maturity date are fixed."
msgstr "대출이 수락되었습니다. 연 이자율과 만기일이 확정되었습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "This loan action is no longer available."
msgstr "이 대출 작업은 더 이상 이용할 수 없습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Player loans require separate city finances."
msgstr "플레이어 간 대출에는 도시별로 분리된 재정이 필요합니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Invalid saved competition data."
msgstr "저장된 경쟁 데이터가 잘못되었습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Awaiting host confirmation…"
msgstr "호스트 확인 대기 중…"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Region %d"
msgstr "지역 %d"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Scored competitions require undeveloped starting terrain. Create a new city."
msgstr "점수를 집계하는 경쟁에는 개발되지 않은 시작 지형이 필요합니다. 새 도시를 만드세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Withdraw"
msgstr "철회"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Quit multiplayer"
msgstr "멀티플레이 종료"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Save the multiplayer game before quitting? All connected players will be "
"disconnected."
msgstr "종료 전에 멀티플레이 게임을 저장하시겠습니까? 연결된 모든 플레이어의 연결이 끊깁니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Save and quit"
msgstr "저장 후 종료"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Quit without saving"
msgstr "저장하지 않고 종료"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can change the game speed."
msgstr "호스트만 게임 속도를 변경할 수 있습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Select a city to visit. You can watch every city and send emergency "
"assistance during disasters."
msgstr "방문할 도시를 선택하세요. 모든 도시를 관찰하고 재해 시 긴급 지원을 보낼 수 있습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Apply colour"
msgstr "색상 적용"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Price for additional neutral land. At the shared start, every city receives "
"an equal free starting area; its treasury stays intact. Saved games retain "
"their rules."
msgstr ""
"추가 중립 토지의 가격입니다. 공유 모드 시작 시 각 도시는 동일한 무료 시작 영역을 받으며 자금은 유지됩니다. 저장된 게임은 기존 "
"규칙을 유지합니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Host a game on this computer, or connect to an existing host."
msgstr "이 컴퓨터에서 게임을 호스트하거나 기존 호스트에 연결하세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Your name in the lobby, chat and scoreboard."
msgstr "대기실, 채팅, 순위표에 표시할 이름입니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Choose a custom colour for your cursor, territory and statistics, then Apply"
" colour."
msgstr "커서, 영토 및 통계에 사용할 색상을 선택한 뒤 색상 적용을 누르세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Enter the host computer's LAN address or reachable IP address."
msgstr "호스트 컴퓨터의 LAN 주소 또는 접속 가능한 IP 주소를 입력하세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The host and joining players must use the same TCP port."
msgstr "호스트와 참가 플레이어는 같은 TCP 포트를 사용해야 합니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Co-op: one shared city. Shared: separate cities on one map. Region: "
"independent neighbouring city maps."
msgstr "협동: 하나의 공동 도시. 공유: 하나의 지도에 별도 도시. 지역: 독립된 이웃 도시 지도."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Generate new terrain, or continue a saved multiplayer game. Saved games keep"
" their rules and player seats."
msgstr "새 지형을 생성하거나 저장된 멀티플레이 게임을 계속하세요. 저장된 게임은 기존 규칙과 플레이어 자리를 유지합니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Leave empty to allow joining without a password."
msgstr "비밀번호 없이 참가하도록 허용하려면 비워 두세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Enter the game's password if the host set one; otherwise leave empty."
msgstr "호스트가 비밀번호를 설정했다면 입력하고, 아니면 비워 두세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Configure the city, then wait in the lobby until everyone is ready."
msgstr "도시를 설정한 뒤 모두 준비될 때까지 대기실에서 기다리세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Connect and select a new or reserved player seat. The host controls the game"
" rules."
msgstr "연결한 뒤 새 자리나 예약된 자리를 선택하세요. 게임 규칙은 호스트가 설정합니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Population: residents of your own city. Suggested targets: 2,000 for a short"
" development goal, 10,000 for a medium goal, 50,000 for a long goal."
msgstr ""
"인구: 내 도시의 주민 수입니다. 권장 목표는 짧은 개발 목표 2,000명, 중간 목표 10,000명, 긴 목표 50,000명입니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Net wealth: treasury minus bank bonds and outstanding player debt. Suggested"
" targets: $50,000, $100,000 or $500,000 for increasingly long economic "
"goals."
msgstr ""
"순자산: 보유 자금에서 은행 채권과 미상환 플레이어 부채를 뺀 금액입니다. 경제 목표는 짧은 순서대로 $50,000, $100,000, "
"$500,000을 권장합니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Build without a victory target or time limit."
msgstr "승리 목표나 시간제한 없이 건설합니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"The target must then be held for one full game year (300 game days). At "
"uninterrupted simulation speed, that year takes about 4 minutes at Turtle, 2"
" at Llama or 1 at Cheetah. Swallow advances one day per processed frame "
"(about 5 seconds per year at 60 simulation frames/s). Development time is "
"additional and depends on difficulty, terrain, experience, pauses and "
"computer performance; these are not match-duration guarantees."
msgstr ""
"이후 게임 시간으로 1년(300일) 동안 목표를 유지해야 합니다. 중단 없이 진행하면 거북이 속도로 약 4분, 라마로 2분, 치타로 "
"1분이 걸립니다. 제비는 처리된 프레임마다 하루 진행합니다(초당 시뮬레이션 60프레임이면 1년에 약 5초). 개발 시간은 별도이며 "
"난이도, 지형, 경험, 일시 정지, 컴퓨터 성능에 따라 달라집니다. 실제 경기 시간을 보장하는 수치는 아닙니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Choose the lender and principal. The game sets the bond rate. Interest "
"settles with the annual budget; there is no maturity date. Repay when funds "
"permit."
msgstr ""
"대출자와 원금을 선택하세요. 채권 이자율은 게임에서 정합니다. 이자는 연간 예산에서 정산하며 만기일은 없습니다. 자금이 충분할 때 "
"상환하세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Lender"
msgstr "대출자"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "%s → %s · %s · %d%% annually"
msgstr "%s → %s · %s · 연 %d%%"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Approve loan"
msgstr "대출 승인"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Outstanding: %s · Unpaid interest: %s"
msgstr "미상환액: %s · 미납 이자: %s"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Repay principal"
msgstr "원금 상환"

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Choose a lender and a principal in $10,000 bond units."
msgstr "대출자와 $10,000 채권 단위의 원금을 선택하세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The normal bond credit limit does not permit this loan."
msgstr "일반 채권 신용 한도로는 이 대출을 허용할 수 없습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Loan requested. The lender must approve the game's bond rate."
msgstr "대출을 요청했습니다. 대출자가 게임의 채권 이자율을 승인해야 합니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "The bond rate or credit limit changed. Send a new request."
msgstr "채권 이자율 또는 신용 한도가 변경되었습니다. 새 요청을 보내세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid ""
"Loan accepted. Interest follows the bond budget; repay the principal when "
"funds permit."
msgstr "대출이 수락되었습니다. 이자는 채권 예산을 따릅니다. 자금이 충분할 때 원금을 상환하세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Insufficient funds to repay this loan."
msgstr "이 대출을 상환할 자금이 부족합니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Loan principal repaid."
msgstr "대출 원금을 상환했습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "City names can only be changed in the lobby."
msgstr "도시 이름은 대기실에서만 변경할 수 있습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "City name updated."
msgstr "도시 이름이 갱신되었습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Click your city name to rename it before the game starts."
msgstr "게임 시작 전에 도시 이름을 클릭하여 변경하세요."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can control disasters."
msgstr "호스트만 재해를 제어할 수 있습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Only the host can control disasters and simulation time."
msgstr "호스트만 재해와 시뮬레이션 시간을 제어할 수 있습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "No purchasable tiles selected. Nothing was charged."
msgstr "구입 가능한 타일을 선택하지 않았습니다. 비용은 청구되지 않았습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Select land belonging to another player to send a purchase request."
msgstr "구입 요청을 보내려면 다른 플레이어의 토지를 선택하세요."

