#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
msgid "Offer price updated. Previous confirmations are no longer valid."
msgstr "매물 가격이 갱신되었습니다. 이전 확인은 더 이상 유효하지 않습니다."

#. OpenSC2K multiplayer UI; supplementary translation from English feature
#. source.
